# Thousand Needles (Horde) - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns whose SOURCE is physically in Thousand Needles
# for a Horde buyer, verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever item vendor and drop tables). Four are vendor-sold by
# in-zone Horde-buyable vendors (Jandia and Montarr at Freewind Post, Jinky
# Twizzlefixxit and Maximillian at Mirage Raceway — every buy carries an
# npc pin to the exact in-zone vendor); five are mob drops with sole
# droppers spawning in-zone (two of them narrow 2-zone drops, shipped with
# both zones named). Two in-zone-sold patterns are Alliance-vendor
# exclusive and two more are 34-vendor generic stock, so neither ships;
# everything else Thousand-Needles-dropping is a generic multi-zone world
# drop (Elwynn rule, argued per case in the inventory); quest records
# carry no reward data, so none of that class ships (see
# docs/thousand-needles-horde-companions-inventory.md and
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Cooking, Enchanting, First
# Aid and Fishing have no Thousand Needles Horde source, so that is
# stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/thousand-needles-horde-recipes
title Thousand Needles (Horde) - Recipes
levels 20-32
zone Thousand Needles
faction Horde
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords thousand needles, horde, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Freewind Post vendor - Jandia's stock (Tailoring)

  zone map 1441

  when skill Tailoring 1

  tip Jandia (46.21, 51.51) at Freewind Post sells the pattern; the shop is Horde, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 5973 "Pattern: Barbaric Leggings" npc 4877
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Freewind Post vendor - Montarr's stock (Alchemy)

  zone map 1441

  when skill Alchemy 1

  tip Montarr (45.15, 50.79) at Freewind Post sells the recipe; the shop is Horde, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 6068 "Recipe: Shadow Oil" npc 4878
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Mirage Raceway - Jinky's schematics (Engineering)

  zone map 1441

  when skill Engineering 1

  tip Jinky Twizzlefixxit (77.68, 77.9) at Mirage Raceway sells both schematics; the shop is neutral, so Horde characters can buy.
  buy 7560 "Schematic: Gnomish Universal Remote" npc 6730
  buy 13309 "Schematic: Lovingly Crafted Boomstick" npc 6730
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way). The Remote also lists a drop off Mekgineer Thermaplugg, who has no spawn point in any zone in the data — unplaceable, so buy-only.

step Mirage Raceway - Maximillian's helmet (Engineering)

  zone map 1441

  when skill Engineering 1

  tip Maximillian "The Greaser" (79.8, 77.2) at Mirage Raceway sells the schematic; the shop is neutral, so Horde characters can buy. Sole vendor anywhere.
  buy 221336 "Schematic: Goblin Mining Helmet" npc 222261
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Galak Mauler grounds - Elixir of Intellect (Alchemy)

  zone map 1441

  when skill Alchemy 1

  loop
  goto 17.18,18.83
  goto 20.75,22
  goto 42.55,32.52
  goto 44.93,32.8
  kill 4095 optional
  collect 250389 "Recipe: Elixir of Intellect" optional
  note Sole dropper is the Galak Mauler, west and center grounds; the same mob also spawns in the Barrens, so both zones are named.

