  zone map 1441

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  loop
  goto 26.67,47.49
  goto 27.4,47.38
  goto 26.72,56.01
  goto 27.06,55.19
  kill 4101 optional
  collect 251385 "Plans: Hard Gold Cuirass" optional
  note Sole dropper is the Screeching Roguefeather, spawning only in-zone.

