step Gravelsnout Surveyor grounds - Earthen Leggings (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1441

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  loop
  goto 11.66,22.79
  goto 12.88,14.74
  goto 64.05,46.9
  goto 66.27,49.56
  goto 67.49,60.12
  kill 4116 optional
  collect 254000 "Pattern: Earthen Leggings" optional
  note Sole dropper is the Gravelsnout Surveyor; the loop covers the 5 in-zone points and the note names its 1 Feralas point.

step No Thousand Needles Horde source - Cooking

  note Cooking has no recipe source physically in Thousand Needles for Horde in the data - no Horde-buyable vendor sells them here and no in-zone mob drops them - so this guide carries nothing for it. Polestar's own profession guides cover trainer-taught staples.

